<title>DENMARK: Danish FLS seeks to buy German-owned firm.</title>
<headline>Danish FLS seeks to buy German-owned firm.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cement and engineering group FLS Industries said on Wednesday its FLS Miljoe subsidiary was exploring the possibility of acquiring German-owned, Copenhagen-based boilermaker Burmeister &amp; Wain Energi A/S.</p>
<p>FLS said in a statement the takeover would take place by end-1997 provided that negotiations were successful and the necessary approval of the boards of the two firms was obtained.</p>
<p>No financial information was provided.</p>
<p>Burmeister &amp; Wain Energi is owned by Deutsche Babcock Energie und Umweittechnik AG. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
